   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Worker Lambda (VPC privada)\n1. deadline vencido → EXPIRED\n2. breaker OPEN → defer (sin intento)\n3. claim: UPDATE → IN_PROGRESS\n4. API interna (Idempotency-Key)\n5. clasifica → SUCCEEDED / retry / DLQ",
   "originalText": "Worker Lambda (VPC privada)\n1. deadline vencido → EXPIRED\n2. breaker OPEN → defer (sin intento)\n3. claim: UPDATE → IN_PROGRESS\n4. API interna (Idempotency-Key)\n5. clasifica → SUCCEEDED / retry / DLQ",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e9ri19r0wyo",
   "autoResize": true,
