   "versionNonce": 1124831726,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Estados: ENQUEUED → IN_PROGRESS → SUCCEEDED\n          ↘ RETRYING ↺        ↘ FAILED_NON_RETRYABLE | FAILED_EXHAUSTED | FAILED_EXPIRED\nDistribución: slot = sha256(id) % 1440 → ~694 jobs/min con 1M (6.944 con 10M)\nCapacidad por proveedor: ≤ 86.400 × k / latencia_seg jobs/día\njobId = registryId#runDate · attempt = llamadas reales · seq = re-encolados\nTimeouts: HTTP 10 s < Worker 30 s < visibility 180 s",
   "originalText": "Estados: ENQUEUED → IN_PROGRESS → SUCCEEDED\n          ↘ RETRYING ↺        ↘ FAILED_NON_RETRYABLE | FAILED_EXHAUSTED | FAILED_EXPIRED\nDistribución: slot = sha256(id) % 1440 → ~694 jobs/min con 1M (6.944 con 10M)\nCapacidad por proveedor: ≤ 86.400 × k / latencia_seg jobs/día\njobId = registryId#runDate · attempt = llamadas reales · seq = re-encolados\nTimeouts: HTTP 10 s < Worker 30 s < visibility 180 s",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "e1erbfqfoeq",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
